    "body": "Supersedes draft PR #167 and carries the already-green SHERIFF_POLICY_V1 forward into the operational OSS control-plane implementation.\n\nHard locks:\n- OPEN-CODE-ONLY control plane/runtime dependencies\n- event-driven; no polling\n- AUTHOR != QC != SHERIFF; SHERIFF cannot self-judge\n- honest FAIL is not a violation; FALSE PASS is critical\n- discipline and skill ratings remain separate\n- GitHub is development transport only; target runtime forge is Forgejo\n\nApproved design: docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-29-sheriff-oss-control-plane-design.md\nImplementation plan: docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-29-sheriff-oss-control-plane.md\n\nCurrent phase: TDD RED Task 1. The branch intentionally contains tests that require OSS topology/provenance files which do not exist yet. Do not merge until exact final HEAD has green hq-validate + sheriff-oss-validate and fresh read-back evidence.\n\nProduction active is explicitly out of scope for this PR; that requires a persistent host and physical end-to-end event/replay proof.",
